idth:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Direct Supervision:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">FTE Hours:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">1.0</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Reports to:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Director of Research</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Position Summary:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">The Institutional Review Board (IRB) Coordinator is responsible for overseeing the review and approval process of research involving human subjects to ensure compliance with federal regulations, institutional policies, and ethical guidelines. This role involves coordinating IRB meetings, reviewing research protocols for completeness, providing guidance to researchers on regulatory requirements, and maintaining accurate records and documentation. The IRB Coordinator serves as a liaison between IRB, researchers, and institutional leadership, ensuring efficient and ethical review processes. Additionally, they may assist in developing and implementing policies, training programs and process improvements related to human subject research protections.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Education:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Bachelor’s degree in business administration or health related field.</span><span style=\"\"></span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Certifications/Licensure:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Certified IRB Professional (CIP®) credential preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Experience:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">One (1) year of experience in a research environment that demonstrates experience with compliance issues and familiarity with research ethics and methods required.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Proficiency with Microsoft Office, particularly Word, Excel and PowerPoint required.</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">One (1) year experience working in an academic healthcare setting preferred.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Schedule:</span></b><span style=\"\"></span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</span><span style=\"\"></span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">May work evenings and weekends as needed.</span><span style=\"\"></span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">May be required to travel.</span><span style=\"\"></span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Please let me know if you have any questions.</span><span style=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Erin Cowder</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Compensation Analyst</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">People Department</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">Tidal Health</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">tidalhealth.org</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></i></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}